{"version":1,"content":"<p>80歲男子董仲賢於上周日（25日）上午在大埔烏蛟騰懷疑行山失蹤，其家人上周二（27日）報案求助。</p><p>連日來警方、消防、民安隊、政府飛行服務隊及義務搜救隊在附近一帶展開搜救行動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:21:19.457461+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:44:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.570449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.659516+00:00","content_hash":"f35c5dca0e7217d73513919c6cd6ba5421080b28693c61fc1ff118b30847fa03","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}